### Student Courses API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/student
@authToken = your-jwt-token-here

### Get Available Courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Courses by Level
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?level=200
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Courses by Semester
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?semester=First
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Courses with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Course Enrollments
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Download Transcript
GET {{baseUrl}}/transcript
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
